        "mobile_bottom": -26,
        "heading": "Websites and Marketing For Tradies",
        "sub_heading": "How An Agency Helps You Stand Out Online",
        "text": "<p>If you're like most tradies, landing small jobs isn’t the problem—your phone’s always buzzing. The real challenge is scoring those bigger, high-paying gigs. Residential and commercial contracts need a different approach since the folks who care more about quality than price aren’t easy to reach.</p><p>Let's be real: the bigger players are nabbing those top jobs before you even get a shot.</p><p>If you’re an electrician aiming for steady, well-paid work, getting online is a must. A solid website and smart marketing plan boost your brand, draw in quality leads, free you from third-party platforms, and even make your business more valuable.</p><p>An Agency is here to help you connect with more customers through our all-in-one website, branding, and marketing services for electricians.</p>",
        "button_link": "#",
        "button_text": "Speak To Our Team",
        "image_right": false,
        "text_align": "left",
        "background_color": "#aeddf9",
        "desktop_padding_top": 60,
