        "heading": "Digital Marketing for Tradesmen Matters",
        "sub_heading": "How An Agency Helps You Stand Out Online",
        "text": "<p>Setting up your business for long-term success starts with the right marketing. You need a smart strategy to build your online presence—this means an optimized website that helps high-level clients find you fast, plus a lead generation system that works with proven advertising. Whether you're an electrician, plumber, carpenter, builder, roofer, or painter, getting noticed by the right clients is key.</p><p>But digital marketing only goes so far without solid branding.</p><p>Your branding shows your professionalism and what your clients can expect from your work. From your website landing page to your business cards and even your van wrap, you want to be proud of the image you're putting out there. An Agency's branding team for tradesmen builds the strong foundation you need for all your digital marketing efforts.</p>",
        "button_link": "#",
        "button_text": "Help Grow My Business",
        "image_right": false,
        "text_align": "left",
        "background_color": "#ffffff",
        "desktop_padding_top": 60,
