        "mobile_top": -25,
        "mobile_right": 0,
        "mobile_bottom": -1,
        "heading": "Advertising Solutions For Aussie Tradesmen",
        "sub_heading": "Profitable advertising that works",
        "text": "<p>For local tradesmen, targeting the right people with your ads is crucial. You don't want to waste your budget or attract clients who aren't the right fit for your services.</p><p>At An Agency, we use hyper-focused targeting in our campaigns because we know the Aussie market inside-out. We set the right parameters so you only spend money where it counts.</p><p>We'll manage your ad campaigns by keeping a close eye on progress and fine-tuning your ads to get the most bang for your buck. Get found in just a few clicks, land high-paying jobs, and be there when urgent requests come in—all thanks to targeted ads.</p>",
