        "text": "<p>SEO is a cost-effective way to get your trade business in front of the right people—turning strangers into paying customers without burning through your ad budget.</p><p>With strong SEO, your website ranks higher on Google, bringing in organic traffic without the need to pay per click. Even if you’re running ads, a solid SEO strategy lowers your overall cost to land new jobs.</p><p>Your best clients want quality and credibility. The businesses that show up at the top of search results are seen as the go-to experts. Our local SEO service covers everything—website audits, content creation, keyword research, and backlink management—so you stand out and get the work you deserve.</p>",
